      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a good start, but a bit generic. can you get more specific about the actual technical enrollment process? specifically, what are the best practices for registering these keys in an enterprise environment (like via Azure AD or Okta) to make sure we don't have a massive backlog of support tickets during the first week? also, how should we handle the 'lost key' scenario for high-level partners so they aren't locked out for hours?",
